WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.321
The Verified Unit makes one production batch the smallest auditable carbon claim.

2
00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:15.675
It must be measured, bounded, attributed, committed and recomputable; if evidence is missing, the result is a refusal or a lower grade.

3
00:00:15.675 --> 00:00:23.162
Grades A, B and C reflect the measured share of the footprint, not a commercial package chosen by the customer.

4
00:00:23.162 --> 00:00:31.495
Every unit carries its method, boundary and chain references, so third parties can reproduce the commitment from public fields.

5
00:00:31.495 --> 00:00:35.623
It is evidence, not an offset, credit or certification.
